**Admission test:** can you name the brain function it fills? If not, it belongs
here. One area = one defect CLASS; individual instances go in VERIFICATION.md.

## Classes

_None yet. Format as:*

    ### C-NNN — <class name>
    **Definition.** What counts as this defect.
    **Why it matters.** The design requirement it implies.
    **Instances.** Filed in VERIFICATION.md, not repeated here.
    **Repair.** Automatic and schema-safe, or needs a human?

## Binding rules

Standards are defined once, in `standards/okf-schema.yaml` and
`standards/WIKI-STANDARDS.md`. **Reference them; never restate their contents
here.** Restating is how the corpus ended up with four conflicting definitions of
its own frontmatter schema, each tool enforcing a different one.
